551	  // Managed first-month-free eligibility. If this account/IP has ALREADY redeemed
552	  // the promo (or it's switched off), re-quote at FULL price so the wallet split,
553	  // the card leg and the stamped total are all full — the free month is a
554	  // once-per-person offer. The wallet path is self-correcting regardless (its
555	  // atomic claim inside placeOrder charges full on a lost claim), but the CARD
